OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 22, charged over death of
OL,4,A80-year-old in Glenrothes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old man has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the death of an
OL,8,F80-year-old man in Glenrothes.
OL,10,FPolice were called to a report of a
OL,11,Fdisturbance in the Dunecht Court area
OL,12,Fat about 03:20 on Saturday.
OL,14,FJames Suttie was pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FThe suspect was due to appear before
OL,18,FKirkcaldy Sheriff Court on Monday.
